{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/407181-recruiting-looking-for-more-players-for-exalted-2-5-game","id":407181,"title":"[Recruiting] Looking for more players for Exalted 2.5 game","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-02-15T17:54:26-08:00","id":407181,"title":"[Recruiting] Looking for more players for Exalted 2.5 game","content":"Now I started a game on skype voice chat a few months ago and we are looking for a few more players. We play 8pm EST on friday, though sometimes we start abit later and normally play around four hours. New players will receive 65 exp. The game is currently set in the north and the group just got done gaining control of a factory cathedral. The stuffs about to hit the fan for them though so new players will have missed the easy stuff.<br /> <br /> All relavent information including character info can be found on the first post of the original <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/265726-back-and-looking-to-play-skype-game-recruiting\">recruitment page.</a><br /> <br /> If you'd like to join post basic character concept, this is a heroic solar game (though we do have one abyssal renegade). Of course if you'd like to listen in on a game to get a feel for things just left me know.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3945,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","user":"Aeroz","date":". 02-15-2015, 09:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-15T18:32:49-08:00","id":407208,"title":"","content":"Fiance is either making a Zenith or a Dawn Solar. I'll make sure he get an account on the forum and posts his character when he is finished.<br /> <br /> He made a Zenith. Favored Melee, War, Sail, Awareness, and Dodge. He has a bear familiar. Still working on motivation and intimacies.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 02-15-2015, 11:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-09T08:26:14-07:00","id":434082,"title":"","content":"Hey I posted something in the original thread but figured I would post something here too. I would love to join and can make those times and have working mic on this new comp. I have to concepts not sure which would fit best without stepping on toes to much. I had an idea for a Night caste vigilante crime fighter/investigator type from nexus that is kind of dark and matter of fact, He fights with paired axes/hatchets. Also had the idea of a Large Burly Warrior Smith/Scholar more noble and jolly of character, master of crafting arms and armor but well educated as well, probably twilight caste. Fight with a Axe/Hammer and a shield.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5280-gfrobbin84","name":"gfrobbin84","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"90"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-26T13:22:56-07:00","id":492867,"title":"","content":"Are you still open to players?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5492-xeno426","name":"Xeno426","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5492_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-27T17:18:26-07:00","id":494110,"title":"","content":"We are actually looking for more people. A few people have left the game for scheduling reasons.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-27T20:18:28-07:00","id":494291,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/407181-recruiting-looking-for-more-players-for-exalted-2-5-game?p=494110#post494110\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We are actually looking for more people. A few people have left the game for scheduling reasons.</div> </div> </div> </div>I've got questions that I don't want to muck up the forums with. Should I PM you or Aeroz?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5492-xeno426","name":"Xeno426","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5492_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-28T00:15:02-07:00","id":494456,"title":"","content":"Aeroz is the storyteller so he has the final say on most things, but if you want to ask me things don't be shy. Keep in mind we currently have a dusk combat monkey who's dabbled in necromancy and craft, a know-it all twilight caste archer who is struggling to keep up with all the utility charms she wants, and a decadent night caste swordsman who can't hold his alcohol. Not having someone who's especially strong in the social department is really starting to hurt subtlety wise.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-28T06:42:14-07:00","id":494702,"title":"","content":"More specifically, the Night caste is a bad drinker (it was just the one time), a better swordsman but his forte is thieving and gambling.<br /> <br /> Oh, and it's a Solar-scale campaign but no Infernals (those are reserved for plot devices by the GM)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","name":"Spaaace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-28T07:57:12-07:00","id":494800,"title":"","content":"A social character would be helpful last game.<br /> <br /> Also, I am thinking about forgetting about most of the Utility charms. I think I am spreading Mayu too thin.<br /> <br /> Now I need to decide to go Linguistics or Sorcery. Linguistics would be more in line with her character, but Sorcery would make a better story.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 04-28-2015, 11:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-28T09:13:42-07:00","id":494895,"title":"","content":"Damn, the sage and the sneak are two of my favorite character types to play. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> I'm much less experience or inclined to play social-focused characters. Social capable, sure, but not really focused. Are you guys using the <a href=\"http://fixalted.bazzalisk.org/index.php?title=Social_Conflict\" target=\"_blank\">social conflict rules</a>?<br /> <br /> The no-infernals doesn't bother me; I was never terribly interested in either them or Abyssals. Lunars and Sidereals are more up to my speed (well, saved for the gimped Lunar crunch for anything not a full moon warrior <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5492-xeno426","name":"Xeno426","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5492_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-28T09:29:13-07:00","id":494935,"title":"","content":"A socially-capable character would be helpful, but we've made our way without one so far. The Night Caste has a good amount of socialize for situations where that is appropriate. I think it's more the one-on-one social bits that we're lacking. I have not interacted sufficiently with those rules, so I don't know. <br /> <br /> That said, it's not a requirement for you to fill perceived gaps in the group. The previous two players that had to drop due to scheduling were a Zenith Martial Artist and a Night Hunter. Make the character you want to play.<br /> <br /> You'll have to talk with Aeroz, but I <i>think </i>non-Solars are allowed. They just might be at a disadvantage against Solar-level opponents.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","name":"Spaaace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-28T09:48:49-07:00","id":494960,"title":"","content":"I've gathered from limited personal experience and being a lurker on the forums for a good long while that if playing a non-Solar in a Solar group (and even a Solar in a Solar group), if there isn't some kind of niche you do that nobody else does you're going to feel like a fifth wheel.<br /> <br /> I've only managed to join two Exalted games that went for more than two sessions, one online and one in person. The in-person one I played a Sidereal of Endings that probably had the best social ability in the group, seeing as most of the other players were very new to the setting. I managing to basically railroad the party to our first goal by enticing everyone to join a caravan to a &quot;tomb of great treasure&quot;\u2014at least that's what I convinced the primary investor by telling him it totally <i>wasn't</i>\u2014which seemed to work out pretty well (not for the investor, the whole thing was a wash for the poor guy).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5492-xeno426","name":"Xeno426","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5492_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-28T09:50:12-07:00","id":494962,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Spaaace</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/407181-recruiting-looking-for-more-players-for-exalted-2-5-game?p=494935#post494935\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A socially-capable character would be helpful, but we've made our way without one so far. The Night Caste has a good amount of socialize for situations where that is appropriate. I think it's more the one-on-one social bits that we're lacking. I have not interacted sufficiently with those rules, so I don't know.</div> </div> </div> </div>While a social focused character would be nice, we have been limping along without one. Mayu can bargain. Alric can lie. Bloodless can intimidate. We are lacking the &quot;get other people to do what we want honestly&quot; type niche. Our shadiness got us in trouble last game. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> So make what character type you want. Mayu is spread pretty thin between all the sage like abilities. Have another character to take on Sorcery or Medicine would be nice. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-28T12:36:45-07:00","id":495091,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/407181-recruiting-looking-for-more-players-for-exalted-2-5-game?p=494962#post494962\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While a social focused character would be nice, we have been limping along without one. Mayu can bargain. Alric can lie. Bloodless can intimidate. We are lacking the &quot;get other people to do what we want honestly&quot; type niche. Our shadiness got us in trouble last game. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>/spittake<br /> <br /> Honesty?! You're doing it wrong! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","name":"Spaaace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-28T12:46:22-07:00","id":495097,"title":"","content":"Hey, now. You were busy puking up your guts last game. Also, this NPC has high investigation and saw through all of our bullshit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-28T13:15:12-07:00","id":495117,"title":"","content":"That was two games ago, he didn't throw up but was rendered unconscious and it was Lunar Poison^M^M^M^M^M^M Liquor in his defence. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","name":"Spaaace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-28T13:37:23-07:00","id":495136,"title":"","content":"Yeah.... Remember you were doing Resistance training? Maybe I'll wait and have Aeroz explain what happened. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-28T22:58:57-07:00","id":495947,"title":"","content":"Well, I sent a PM to Aeroz earlier yesterday morning. I plan to just listen in for one session to get a feel for the group and what would work. I like to make a character that will mesh with a group and the tone of the game; it's probably why Neutral is the most common alignment I seem to pick when playing D&amp;D. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I've also experience making a character who's motivation just never came up during gameplay. 15 sessions and only once did I manage to benefit from moving towards my motivation. I'd like to avoid that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5492-xeno426","name":"Xeno426","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5492_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-28T23:33:01-07:00","id":495989,"title":"","content":"The game tends to lean towards silly slice of life stuff even though there is heavy stuff here and there. Think one of those shonen anime's with a million episodes to them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-30T15:34:44-07:00","id":497938,"title":"","content":"got your PM and will answer stuff in detail privately as its just more convenient. This however I will say here for the sake of any others that might wish to join. The group hobbles along without being too social because I kind of force them to have some competence in multiple skills. I dont think there is a single ability we haven't rolled at some point, and yes there have been times I've had them roll dodge.<br /> <br /> Niche is fine but dont focus too much on it. I do a mix of everything including investigation, social scenes, combat, even trade contracts. So if you focus too much on one thing you'll find yourself bored out of your mind for decent chunks of the game. I also discourage min/maxing so dont worry too much about being overshadowed. The Dusk is the heavy hitter but even our book worm twilight has made some significant contributions to fights.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-30T16:08:52-07:00","id":497961,"title":"","content":"I think performance is the only ability that none of us have. We almost got drowned by fair folk because of it. Good times. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> (Note: I'm not saying that you should take performance. I kind of like the fact that all the character are tone deaf. )","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 04-30-2015, 07:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-14T18:24:29-07:00","id":514684,"title":"","content":"My girlfriend and myself are interested in joining the game. We've both played a long time and I've run and am currently running a game. I'd really look forward to the chance to play in a game (a rare thing for me). I've got several characters that I could adapt to the setting and it's always fun coming up with new concepts as well. If you let us in, I'd probably play as a Infernal/Lunar and she'd play as a Solar/Abyssal but could play a Lunar. I always use Obsidian Portal to keep all the info for my games - I would welcome the chance to provide such a resource for your game as well.<br /> <br /> On Skype, my profile is provided via PM.<br /> <br /> Thanks!<br /> <br /> (Put this in the old thread - sorry about that)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0